y of graphs. Zenodo, 2022. doi:10.5281/zenodo.7457820 . [HMSV09] Benjamin Howard, John Millson, Andrew Snowden, and Ravi Vakil. The equations for the moduli space of $n$ points on the line. Duke Math. J. , 146(2):175–226, 2009. doi:10.1215/00127094-2008-063 . [Izm09] Ivan Izmestiev. Projective background of the infinitesimal rigidity of frameworks. Geom. Dedicata , 140(1):183–203, 2009. doi:10.1007/s10711-008-9339-9 . [JO19] Bill Jackson and John C. Owen. Equivalent realisations of a rigid graph. Discrete Appl. Math. , 256:42–58, 2019. doi:10.1016/j.dam.2017.12.009 . [Kee92] Sean Keel. Intersection theory of moduli space of stable $n$ -pointed curves of genus zero. Trans. Amer. Math. Soc. , 330(2):545–574, 1992. doi:10.2307/2153922 . [Lam70] Gerard Laman. On graphs and rigidity of plane skeletal structures. J. Engrg. Math. , 4:331–340, 1970. doi:10.1007/BF01534980 . [Pog73] Aleksei V. Pogorelov. Extrinsic geometry of convex surfaces . American Mathematical Society, Providence, R.I., 1973. Translated from the Russian by Israel Program for Scientific Translations, Translations of Mathematical Monographs, Vol. 35. doi:10.1090/mmono/035 . [Pol27] Hilda Pollaczek-Geiringer. Über die Gliederung ebener Fachwerke. Z. Angew. Math. Mech. , 7:58–72, 1927. doi:10.1002/zamm.19270070107 . [SHK + 21] Mahdi Sadjadi, Varda F. Hagh, Mingyu Kang, Meera Sitharam, Robert Connelly, Steven J. Gortler, Louis Theran, Miranda Holmes-Cerfon, and Michael F. Thorpe. Realizations of Isostatic Material Frameworks. physica status solidi (b) , 258(9):2000555, 2021. doi:10.1002/pssb.202000555 . [ST10] Reinhard Steffens and Thorsten Theobald. Mixed volume techniques for embeddings of Laman graphs. Comput. Geom. , 43(2):84–93, 2010. doi:10.1016/j.comgeo.2009.04.004 . [SW07] Franco V. Saliola and Walter Whiteley. Some notes on the equivalence of first-order rigidity in various geometries. 2007. Preprint. doi:10.48550/arXiv.0709.3354 . (MG) University of Trieste, Department of Mathematics and Geoscience